  What:the healing floor,desc:Reliable — inbound sequencing and retransmit — the lossy partner is the adversary the floor is proven against
    Doc:Ghost/N/Reliable.g
    Point,method:inseq_admit,desc:in-order admission — buffer the gap — release what is ready
    Point,method:retx_due,desc:which emits to resend and which are dead
    Point,method:retx_delay,desc:backoff per attempt
    Point,method:make_lossy_partner,desc:a carrier that drops and reorders on purpose
    Doc:Ghost/N/Peeroleum.g
    Point,method:Peeroleum_retx_sweep,desc:the resend clock over every outbox
    Point,method:Peeroleum_liveness_sweep,desc:no inbound for dead ms → mark the Pier silent
